contentText:
Grupo Niche has signed a booking deal with Cárdenas Marketing Network (CMN), Billboard can announce. The renowned Colombian salsa group joins a star-studded roster that includes Marc Anthony, Christian Nodal and Ana Gabriel.

The announcement comes on the heels of Niche’s successful Legacy Tour, which celebrated the salsa group’s 45th anniversary across 75 shows in 15 countries, including the United States, Europe and Latin America.&nbsp;Under the new alliance, CMN will bring Grupo Niche to new stages, expanding its global reach and delivering memorable live experiences.

